/**
 * @defgroup MCC_BuildGuide_Dependency Foundation Dependency
 * @ingroup MCC_BuildGuide
 * @brief Foundation source dependency contract.
 *
 * MCC links `Foundation::Foundation` publicly. Its pinned source baseline is
 * Foundation `0.0.1`, which brings CPSTL `0.0.1` with it.
 *
 * For a source build, `cmake/MCCFoundation.cmake` first reuses a
 * `Foundation::Foundation` target supplied by the parent project. Otherwise,
 * with `MCC_FETCH_FOUNDATION` enabled (the default), it obtains the Foundation
 * sources at tag `v0.0.1` with `FetchContent` and builds them with MCC's
 * toolchain.
 *
 * `FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_FOUNDATION` substitutes a local Foundation working
 * copy for the download. Set `MCC_FETCH_FOUNDATION=OFF` only when the parent
 * project already provides `Foundation::Foundation`.
 *
 * An exported MCC Release package is a separate distribution workflow. Its
 * `MCCConfig.cmake` uses `find_dependency(Foundation)` when a downstream
 * project consumes the package.
 */
